# {2/U}{2/R}{2/W}, "Tap target creature. Put three stun counters on it. Exile the top two cards of your library. Choose one of them. Until the end of your next
# turn, you may play that card." On turn 3 three Moxen (U, R, W) pay one coloured mana per symbol. Bot2's Ornithopter is tapped and stunned (a Mox is no creature
# and is refused), so on turn 4 it stays tapped and one counter comes off instead (CR 122.1d). Bot1 exiles a Mountain and a Lightning Bolt and chooses the Bolt:
# the Mountain is refused on turn 5 although Bot1 has its land drop, and the Bolt is cast from exile with the Ruby.

